```css
.btn { font: 600 14px/1 Inter, 'Pretendard', sans-serif; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 22px; border: 0; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; cursor: pointer; transition: background 200ms ease; }
